person "==Owner\n<size:16>[Person]</size>\n\nSets direction, signs mandates, talks to keepers in product spaces" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxQZXJzb24=>> as Owner
person "==Co-founder / operator\n<size:16>[Person]</size>\n\nRuns nodes, reviews architecture, attaches to sessions" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxQZXJzb24=>> as Cofounderoperator
rectangle "==Matrix Homeserver (a2a)\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nSpaces, rooms and threads; a2a mailbox and identities" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as MatrixHomeservera2a
rectangle "==Model Providers\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nAnthropic, OpenAI, local inference-manager endpoints" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as ModelProviders
rectangle "==Remote Host\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nMac mini with subscriptions, runs the remote harness side" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as RemoteHost
rectangle "==Git Repositories\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nOne repo per project" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as GitRepositories

rectangle "Swarm Platform\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-U3dhcm0gUGxhdGZvcm0=>> {
  person "==Agent Harness Session\n<size:16>[Container: Native CLI]</size>\n\nClaude Code, Codex, Muse or Pi process in a Curator managed tool home (HOME kept)" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsSGFybmVzcw==>> as SwarmPlatform.AgentHarnessSession
  rectangle "==Bridge (M3)\n<size:16>[Container: agent-session-bridge]</size>\n\nHosts provider processes; trust gate; durable bridge-local admission; host enqueue; audience-checked outbox; tails" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.BridgeM3
  rectangle "==Trust\n<size:16>[Container: mandate CLI + library]</size>\n\ncurator-trust + mandates: exact-byte verification, grants with attenuation-only delegation, revocation snapshots, capability tokens; assurance mode T today, mode S through OS-user isolation (v1.3)" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.Trust
  rectangle "==Remote Executor\n<size:16>[Container: rwh]</size>\n\nRuns a harness on another host from a pin-carrying launch intent; tools run in the remote workplace on this host; returns the accepted pin and plan digest" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.RemoteExecutor
  rectangle "==Remote Workplace\n<size:16>[Container: OS user + rwh]</size>\n\nOne OS user on this host for a remote harness: SSH by the pinned key, tool calls run inside the user boundary, kernel firewall per UID; the component name is pending the owner's decision" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.RemoteWorkplace
  rectangle "==Launch Dispatcher\n<size:16>[Container: Go daemon]</size>\n\nOptional module: run accounting (ids, status, wait, cancel, reconcile after a crash), local host capacity, OS-user lifecycle through one privileged helper; checks the spawn grant (attenuation only); the board's spawn calls it; without it the orchestrator calls the launcher directly" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.LaunchDispatcher
  rectangle "==Key Keeper\n<size:16>[Container: privileged daemon]</size>\n\nMaster secret in hardware-backed storage; hierarchical key derivation per agent identity (never per OS path); signs and decrypts on request over a local socket, identifying the caller by peer UID; publishes the root and descendant signatures; never releases a private key" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.KeyKeeper
  rectangle "==Credential Broker\n<size:16>[Container: privileged daemon]</size>\n\nHolds long-lived provider logins; hands each launch what its harness consumes (node-backed token in env or API key through the admitted helper mode; material only to the admitted agent-side executor/holder after UID transition); tracks expiry; relays the vendor's own re-login flow to the operator's phone" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.CredentialBroker
  rectangle "==Agent Workplace\n<size:16>[Container: OS user + kernel firewall]</size>\n\nOne OS user per autonomous agent: private home (0700, no parent ACL), kernel firewall admitting only the message broker and the egress proxy; created and removed by the dispatcher's helper; the unit of mode S" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.AgentWorkplace
  rectangle "==Model Router\n<size:16>[Container: curator-model-router]</size>\n\nModel and effort per task class" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.ModelRouter
  rectangle "==Network Profiles\n<size:16>[Container: curator-network-profiles]</size>\n\nEgress profiles and conformance probe" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.NetworkProfiles
  rectangle "==Capacity (S3)\n<size:16>[Container: extracted from task-board]</size>\n\nSlots, per-host gates (disk, CPU idle, build lock, syspolicyd), lease transfer, validation FIFO (board part B6)" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.CapacityS3
  rectangle "==Product Registry / Keeper\n<size:16>[Container: curator-keeper registry]</size>\n\nProducts, projects, versioned project bindings (hosts, base, remote workplace, egress, rooms, role bindings with slots, team), up after reboot" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.ProductRegistryKeeper
  rectangle "==Environment Manager\n<size:16>[Container: Curator + skill-registry]</size>\n\nRole profiles, skills, MCP, command environment, managed tool homes, launch-env fragments (v3, then v4); curator playbook check" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.EnvironmentManager
  rectangle "==Board\n<size:16>[Container: task-board kernel + curator-playbook]</size>\n\nTask management with externally configured flows (Playbook.json) under kernel guards; a client of the launcher, bridge, capacity and registry; built in Phase 4" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.Board
  rectangle "==Launcher (thin client)\n<size:16>[Container: curator run (canonical) / swarm launch (optional wrapper)]</size>\n\nLaunch transaction: prepare, capacity, compose, compare expect_pin, admit, start, initialize, ready, with compensation. Never reads a fragment or store content, spells a flag, execs or holds" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.Launcherthinclient
  rectangle "==Composer\n<size:16>[Container: curator-run + agents-management (one construction site)]</size>\n\nThe only composer and fragment reader: resolves the role profile, builds one Decision 0013 plan (interactive, headless, hosted-stream with session-start permission frames); compose-only and compare-only answers" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.Composer
  rectangle "==Session Host (M1 + M2)\n<size:16>[Container: agent-session-host (Phase-0 baseline: tb-sessiond)]</size>\n\nOne codebase: supervisor, minimal execution holders, host-enforced admission and fences, Context Engine package, goal ledger, host-owned journal" <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as SwarmPlatform.SessionHostM1M2
}

